@startuml SEQ_07_MENGELOLA_ASLAB
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-07: Mengelola Aslab (Asisten Lab) Praktikum

actor       "SuperAdmin"                    as SuperAdmin

actor       "Admin"                    as User
boundary    "Browser"                  as Browser
control     "AslabPraktikumController" as Controller
entity      "AslabPraktikum Model"     as Model
entity      "User Model"               as ModelU

== Lihat Daftar Aslab ==

User    ->  Browser    : Buka tab "Aslab" di halaman praktikum

Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/aslab

Controller -> Model    : Query aslab berdasarkan praktikum
Model --> Controller   : Data aslab
Controller -> ModelU   : Query kandidat aslab (asisten di lab)
ModelU --> Controller  : Data kandidat
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman daftar aslab
Browser    --> User    : Tampilkan list aslab + dropdown pilih aslab baru

== Tambah / Assign Aslab ==

User    ->  Browser    : Pilih user dari dropdown, klik "Assign Aslab"

Browser ->  Controller : POST /praktikum/{id}/aslab {user_id}

Controller -> Model    : Cek apakah sudah terdaftar
Model --> Controller   : Hasil cek
alt Belum terdaftar
  Controller -> Model : create({praktikum_id, user_id})
  Model --> Controller : Hasil proses
  Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
  Browser --> User    : Aslab muncul di daftar
else Sudah terdaftar
  Controller --> Browser : Pesan error user sudah menjadi aslab
  Browser --> User    : Tampil pesan error
end

== Hapus / Unassign Aslab ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Hapus" pada baris aslab, konfirmasi

Browser ->  Controller : DELETE /praktikum/{id}/aslab/{aslabId}

Controller -> Model    : delete()
Model --> Controller   : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Aslab dihapus dari daftar

@enduml